you can do as flirt buddies.

595
00:38:50,910 --> 00:38:52,910
Can we upgrade from flirt buddies

596
00:38:53,850 --> 00:38:55,600
to kissing partners?

597
00:39:21,980 --> 00:39:23,220
You two

598
00:39:23,240 --> 00:39:25,070
have no sense of public space.

599
00:39:27,260 --> 00:39:29,120
Excuse me, where is the restroom?

600
00:39:31,740 --> 00:39:32,900
Over there.

601
00:39:46,140 --> 00:39:47,150
So weird.

602
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:48,930
What's wrong?

603
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:53,510
I can smell
your friend Saengnuea's pheromone

604
00:39:53,510 --> 00:39:54,410
on Naphitch.

605
00:39:56,270 --> 00:39:57,760
But they shouldn't even

606
00:39:58,120 --> 00:39:59,400
know each other.

607
00:40:00,940 --> 00:40:02,740
Maybe my nose is playing tricks.

608
00:40:03,990 --> 00:40:05,230
I think

609
00:40:05,260 --> 00:40:07,310
I need to smell a Beta

610
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:09,350
to recalibrate.

611
00:40:13,770 --> 00:40:15,990
Ouch, it hurts.

612
00:40:42,290 --> 00:40:43,420
It smells like rain.

613
00:40:43,870 --> 00:40:44,640
Yeah.

614
00:40:48,300 --> 00:40:49,310
He's here.

615
00:41:11,700 --> 00:41:12,800
Are you alright?

616
00:41:16,520 --> 00:41:18,680
Nakhun, what brings you here?

617
00:41:18,700 --> 00:41:19,910
Where is your friend?

618
00:41:21,860 --> 00:41:23,140
Phatsa isn't here.

619
00:41:23,170 --> 00:41:24,840
He's right here.

620
00:41:28,890 --> 00:41:30,190
Be honest.

621
00:41:31,340 --> 00:41:32,800
You can't fool my brother.

622
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:46,730
Wow, Nakhun really is like a hound.

623
00:41:46,750 --> 00:41:48,920
He can track you just by scent.

624
00:42:08,230 --> 00:42:09,130
Ah.

625
00:42:10,370 --> 00:42:14,140
It has nothing to do with me.

626
00:42:14,890 --> 00:42:18,560
I'm off to work.

627
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,300
Come with me.

628
00:42:48,120 --> 00:42:49,450
