707
00:50:39,740 --> 00:50:41,340
I thought it belonged to Jim.

708
00:50:50,940 --> 00:50:51,450
Phatsa.

709
00:50:52,670 --> 00:50:55,530
If there's any
misunderstanding between us later,

710
00:50:56,510 --> 00:50:57,750
